<section style="background-image:url('/assets/img/hiredevelopers/her2.webp'); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: cover; background-position: center; " width="100%" height="300px">
    <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-white pt-5 pb-5">PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT & LAUNCH</h1>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-7 text-center">
                @*  <img src="~/assets/img/hiredevelopers/DevImg.png" width="60%" height="60%" />*@
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section><!-- End Hero -->

<!-- Product Management Content -->
<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-8" align="justify">
                <h3><b>From Product Idea to Development</b></h3>
                <p>Turning a product vision into reality requires close collaboration between product, design, engineering, and business teams. iFOX Solutions supports structured product development from validated requirements through delivery.</p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Translate product objectives into clear requirements and user stories.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Prioritize development work around customer and business value.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Collaborate with design and engineering teams throughout delivery.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Support Agile development and iterative product delivery.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Maintain quality and alignment throughout the development lifecycle.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul><br />
                <h3><b>Preparing for a Successful Product Launch</b></h3>
                <p>A successful launch requires more than completing development. Product teams need clear readiness criteria, stakeholder alignment, customer communication, and measurable launch objectives.</p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Launch Readiness: Confirm product functionality, quality, documentation, and operational readiness.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Release Planning: Coordinate product releases with business and technical teams.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Go-to-Market Alignment: Align product messaging, customer communication, and launch activities.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Success Metrics: Define measurable adoption, engagement, and business outcomes.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Feedback Collection: Capture early customer feedback to identify improvement opportunities.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4 Imgborder">
                <div><img src="~/assets/img/dynamics365/woman analyzing-checking-finance-graphs-office.webp" class="img-fluid text-center m-3" /></div>
                <div><img src="~/assets/img/dynamics365/mod woman-equipped-computer-lab.webp" class="img-fluid text-center m-3" /></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<!-- End Product Management Content -->

